        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Gungrave G.O.R.E is a third-person action shooter that follows Grave, a resurrected gunslinger seeking revenge against a powerful criminal organization. Combining gunplay with close-range combat, players battle through hordes of enemies using dual pistols, powerful special attacks, and Grave's transformable coffin weapon.\n\nThe game emphasizes fast-paced, combo-driven action and cinematic battles while continuing the story of the Gungrave series with themes of vengeance, loyalty, and redemption.",
